This product is a bundle for DeepSeek Harness (dsh). It ships no third-party
source code and no dependencies. Its preset declarations reference packages
published by DeepSeek as part of DeepSeek Harness:

  @deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-persona
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-instructions
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-time-context
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs            @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs-search
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-bash          @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pwsh
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-todo          @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-jobs
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-ask-user      @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-skill
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-web           @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-present
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-command-goal       @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-goal
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-filesystem
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic   @deepseek-ai/dsh-command-compact
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-tool-result-pruner

